## Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

**ImportError: No module named '{{ project_slug }}'**
```bash
# Ensure you're in the project directory and dependencies are installed
uv sync --group dev
```

{% if create_examples %}
**CUDA out of memory**
```bash
# Reduce batch size or use CPU
{{ project_slug }}-cli vision --accelerator cpu
```

{% endif %}
**Permission denied when running scripts**
```bash
# Make sure scripts are executable
chmod +x scripts/release.sh
```

For more help, check the [API Reference](reference/{{ project_slug }}/cli.md) or open an issue on GitHub.
